{"title":"2011 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561c5773b1c1e3b2fa6beaf13308200c7c86bfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" /> is the point of intersection of the lines with equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/0/ff065c1cd089c7d45a7ce464e2a9b8c6dd782a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c996f9cee55ba5ebf8f67095a38813a1f45cb4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lines must go through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561c5773b1c1e3b2fa6beaf13308200c7c86bfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77ba6189a32e5ead2cbb44585ede2285792545c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> into the first equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e3638ca1f0a0799109f985836575cae174586293.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 = 2a - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/890ca056740c7feee9cd0872fcd8454f781f4a5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 2 + 4 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/3808a675e05e62b33a894f8b79267cedce96ca61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{6}{2} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>This means that the point must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea44bd62795a5d84c16a028ff4fb079a5cb8e63f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> into the second equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/e/e1eb9cca579772a9c2a4a091c13d751d2950808a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 = 3 + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bce753f059431c3093f30e5d71869609a281811a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2 - 3 = \\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"135\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224716\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2685/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.918      1 2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.918      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36061:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224716 and revision id 279794. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}